  "summary": "Declared correction of delivered work needs a current unhealthy verdict, exact diagnosis, strategy, affected predicates/findings and bound evidence. Consequence-based workflows use coordinator authority without an independent consent gate. Implementation returns to execution and break-fix to repair. No worker failure disposition is required; completion stays fail-closed until every predicate is healthy and comparable.",
